**Quantity Selector** (with psychology):
- Default: 1
- Options: 1, 2, 3, 5 (Buy more, save more)
- Below quantity: "🔥 Buy 2, Get 10% OFF" (bundle incentive)

**Urgency Indicator**:
- Stock level: "Only 7 left in stock!" (orange text)
- Demand indicator: "🔥 High demand - 12 people have this in cart"

**Social Proof Section**:
- "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Rated #1 Smart Lock by TechReview"
- Customer photo gallery (2-3 thumbnail images)
- "✅ Verified Purchase" badge on reviews

**Key Features** (benefit-focused bullets):
- ✅ Control from anywhere with app
- ✅ Works with Alexa & Google Home
- ✅ Easy 15-minute installation
- ✅ Saves 30% on energy bills

**Triple CTA Strategy**:
1. **Primary**: "Add to Cart" (large green button, full-width)
   - Changes to "✓ Added!" on click with checkmark animation
2. **Alternative**: "Buy Now" (orange button, direct checkout)
   - Skips cart, goes straight to checkout
3. **Soft CTA**: "View Full Details" (text link)
   - Opens product details page for researchers

**Trust Seals** (bottom):
- SSL Secure | Money-Back Guarantee | Award-Winning Support

**Exit Intent** (when trying to close modal):
- Mini popup: "Add this to wishlist to save for later?" with email capture

